      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A system that supplies cold water for domestic use (drinking, bathing, cooking and washing) into a building, typically from a municipality or a well. Domestic water is normally potable; potability is a property of the water itself (see Potable_Water) rather than of the system that distributes it."
      }
